# ggen-graph-wasm-pack-verify project ontology — deliberately empty of individuals.
#
# ggen-graph-wasm-pack's own ontology.ttl is a complete, closed model of the
# gwp:WasmQueryEngineCrateSpec individual its three templates query; this consumer
# adds no project-specific facts on top of it (mirrors examples/claude-code-pack-verify/
# schema/domain.ttl's same posture). This file exists only to satisfy `[ontology] source`
# in ggen.toml — the real domain facts come entirely from the wired pack.

@prefix gwp: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/ggen-graph-wasm#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
